    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey i was doing some acoustic monitoring near the city hall building tonight and i picked up these weird sub-audible pulses. they're hitting around 14-17Hz and the amplitude is consistent every few minutes. i've been feeling really lethargic and \"foggy\" lately and i think these might be localized frequencies meant to affect mood or compliance. can you help me look into what kind of intent would be behind using those specific decibel levels and frequencies?",
